abstract: >-
  ECHO-CLAW is an experimental AI Remote Viewing framework with a durable
  Session Engine, blind-target isolation, protocol validation, Reveal gating,
  target exposure history, a Monitor-Viewer architecture, and an OpenClaw integration candidate with persistent blind Viewer sessions and durable provider-call evidence. Software code is
  MIT licensed. Original protocols, targets and project content are separately
  licensed under CC BY 4.0 as described in NOTICE.md.
